Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:04:17 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fujisan: add stock AT&T B37 FPC legacy module

fingerprint.fpc.so + lib_fpc_tac_shared.so (lib/lib64) from the AT&T B37
system image; they match the AT&T TA (fpcapp64) in the modem partition.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 fujisan-vendor.mk                              |   4 ++++
 proprietary/vendor/lib/hw/fingerprint.fpc.so   | Bin 0 -> 30360 bytes
 proprietary/vendor/lib/lib_fpc_tac_shared.so   | Bin 0 -> 42548 bytes
 proprietary/vendor/lib64/hw/fingerprint.fpc.so | Bin 0 -> 30856 bytes
 proprietary/vendor/lib64/lib_fpc_tac_shared.so | Bin 0 -> 47160 bytes
 5 files changed, 4 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 proprietary/vendor/lib/hw/fingerprint.fpc.so
 create mode 100644 proprietary/vendor/lib/lib_fpc_tac_shared.so
 create mode 100644 proprietary/vendor/lib64/hw/fingerprint.fpc.so
 create mode 100644 proprietary/vendor/lib64/lib_fpc_tac_shared.so

